{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your character, and get ready to run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action Study Runner is a time-based, dual-choice learning game where you take control of a runner. Each question you answer correctly will result in your runner receiving a speed boost. Complete the course as fast as possible, and strive for your personal best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game allows the user to input text entries, which lets anyone create their own custom sets of study data. Use this study data within the game, and put yourself to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who do not know how to get started with their own custom study material, Action Study Runner also comes with examples which are pre-installed with the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pre-installed example study data consists of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Language: Japanese - Hiragana, Katakana, as well as some Kanji and vocabulary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0History: Sequential list of United States Presidents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Science: Periodic Table element symbols that are derived from Latin</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3953000?t=1763469973","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953000/59190479c3764367c2b4c55e9d665f92a1bd1bf1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1763469973","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953000/a0b5516fc327ac11c7a4c6449b6b27315befe7f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763469973","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953000/a0b5516fc327ac11c7a4c6449b6b27315befe7f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763469973","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your character, and get ready to run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action Study Runner is a time-based, dual-choice learning game where you take control of a runner. Each question you answer correctly will result in your runner receiving a speed boost. Complete the course as fast as possible, and strive for your personal best!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game allows the user to input text entries, which lets anyone create their own custom sets of study data. Use this study data within the game, and put yourself to the test!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For those who do not know how to get started with their own custom study material, Action Study Runner also comes with examples which are pre-installed with the game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pre-installed example study data consists of:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Language: Japanese - Hiragana, Katakana, as well as some Kanji and vocabulary</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0History: Sequential list of United States Presidents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0Science: Periodic Table element symbols that are derived from Latin</p></li></ul>","developers":["GUAVACOM LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3953000/0b989b38cd78ad7e576ce804621ef83b982eae94/header.jpg?t=1763469973","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 22.04 / SteamOS 3.6.19<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 8th Gen intel i5 Processor<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><st